#6301
The West Cloister~
   A covered walk runs around a small garden of medicinal herbs, gone to
seed for lack of hands to tend it. Wounded men sit along the walls in the
weak sun, wrapped in blankets. Sisters in white move among them with bowls
of broth and clean bandages.
