#6302
The Herb Garden~
   Beds of herbs fill the cloister garth, bordered by low box hedges:
feverfew, comfrey, poppy, and rows of plants you do not recognise. A stone
basin of clear water stands in the middle, the only clean water you have
seen outside the Temple.
