#6304
The Hospice Gate~
   The hospice's southern gate stands open at the top of the hill. Below,
the Refugee Camps spread out in a grey haze of smoke. Stretcher-bearers come
and go without rest, and a sister at the gate decides who is carried in and
who is turned away.
