#6305
The Chapel of the Last Rites~
   A plain chapel lit by banks of candles. Bodies lie on biers before the
altar, wrapped in white, waiting for the rites to be spoken over them so
that they will rest. A priest moves from bier to bier, his voice hoarse, his
hands never still.
