#6306
The Long Infirmary~
   A long hall lined with beds, every one of them full. Men missing limbs,
men with wounds that will not close, men who stare at the ceiling and
whisper about the West. The smell of blood and vinegar is overpowering. A
door at the end leads to the surgery.
