#6308
The Physician's Study~
   Books on anatomy and herb lore crowd the shelves, and the desk is buried
in notes. A jar on the desk holds a sample of grey, soft grain beside a
sketch of a blotched human arm. Across the top of the notes is written, and
underlined three times: IT IS NOT A DISEASE.
