#6312
The Mortuary~
   A cold, low vault where the dead are washed and wrapped. Stone slabs hold
shrouded bodies, and more lie on the floor between them. Some of the shrouds
have grey stains spreading through the linen. A heavy door in the east wall
is chained and padlocked.
