The Sexton's Room~
   A cramped room beside the mortuary where the sexton lives and keeps the
keys to the catacombs. A cot, a bottle, a lantern, and a heavy iron ring of
keys on a nail. The sexton has started drinking before noon, and he keeps a
mattock within reach of his cot.
