#6318
The Deep Catacomb~
   The oldest part of the catacombs, carved before Midgaard had walls. The
niches here hold abbots and abbesses of the hospice, laid out in their robes
with their hands folded. Many of the robes are empty. A sealed door at the
end has been broken open from the inside.
